   "source": [
    "## 1. vLLM 核心技术 —— PagedAttention\n",
    "\n",
    "**传统 KV Cache 问题**：\n",
    "- KV 块大小固定，容易浪费或 OOM\n",
    "- 请求结束时需要释放所有 block\n",
    "- 不同请求的 KV 块难以复用\n",
    "\n",
    "**PagedAttention 的改进**：\n",
    "- 类似操作系统的「虚拟内存」，把 KV cache 划分成固定大小的 block\n",
    "- 请求只需要连续的 block（按 token 数量分配）\n",
    "- 请求完成时释放 block，其他请求可以复用\n",
    "\n",
    "**性能提升**：\n",
    "- 显存利用率提升 2-3 倍\n",
    "- 支持更高并发度（PagedAttention 内存连续，减少碎片）\n",
    "- 降低 OOM 风险"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 测试 PagedAttention 内存利用率\n",
    "def test_paged_attention():\n",
    "    pat = PagedAttentionSim(NUM_BLOCKS=50, BLOCK_SIZE=16)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 场景 1：单个长请求\n",
    "    long_req_tokens = 128  # 8 blocks\n",
    "    pat.allocate(long_req_tokens)\n",
    "    usage_1 = pat.memory_usage()\n",
    "    print(f'单长请求（{long_req_tokens} tokens）：{usage_1} / {50*16} = {usage_1/(50*16):.2%}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 场景 2：多个短请求\n",
    "    pat.free([i for i in range(8)])  # 释放 block\n",
    "    batch = [32, 48, 64, 80, 96, 112]  # 每个请求\n",
    "    for tokens in batch:\n",
    "        pat.allocate(tokens)\n",
    "    usage_2 = pat.memory_usage()\n",
    "    print(f'批量短请求（{len(batch)} 个）：{usage_2} / {50*16} = {usage_2/(50*16):.2%}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 场景 3：交替添加请求\n",
    "    pat.free([i for i in range(42)])  # 释放大部分 block\n",
    "    for i in range(20):\n",
    "        tokens = random.randint(16, 128)\n",
    "        pat.allocate(tokens)\n",
    "    usage_3 = pat.memory_usage()\n",
    "    print(f'交替请求（20 个）：{usage_3} / {50*16} = {usage_3/(50*16):.2%}')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(test_paged_attention())"
   ]
  },
