    "## 2. Prefix Cache / Continuous Batching\n",
    "\n",
    "**Continuous Batching**：\n",
    "- 允许多个「部分完成」的请求共享 GPU\n",
    "- 每个 request 有独立的 output token 数组\n",
    "- GPU 按步更新所有 pending requests 的 KV cache\n",
    "- 请求完成后，block 被释放给新请求\n",
    "\n",
    "**Prefix Cache**：\n",
    "- 相同 prompt（或前缀）的请求可以直接复用 KV cache\n",
    "- vLLM 会检测 prompt hash，命中后直接返回 KV cache\n",
    "- 缓解「大量相同问题（如冷启动阶段）」的性能问题"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟 Prefix Cache\n",
    "class PrefixCacheSim:\n",
    "    def __init__(self):\n",
    "        self.cache = {}  # prompt_hash -> kv_cache_blocks\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def get(self, prompt: str) -> Optional[list[int]]:\n",
    "        h = hashlib.md5(prompt.encode()).hexdigest()[:8]\n",
    "        return self.cache.get(h)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def set(self, prompt: str, blocks: list[int]):\n",
    "        h = hashlib.md5(prompt.encode()).hexdigest()[:8]\n",
    "        self.cache[h] = blocks\n",
    "\n",
    "    def hit_rate(self):\n",
    "        return sum(1 for v in self.cache.values() if v is not None) / len(self.cache) if self.cache else 0\n",
    "\n",
    "async def simulate_prefix_cache():\n",
    "    pc = PrefixCacheSim()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 生成 20 个请求，其中 5 个是重复的\n",
    "    prompts = [\n",
    "        'What is machine learning?',\n",
    "        'Explain RAG system.',\n",
    "        'What is machine learning?',  # 重复\n",
    "        'Explain RAG system.',  # 重复\n",
    "        'What is AI?',\n",
    "        'What is machine learning?',  # 重复\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for i, prompt in enumerate(prompts):\n",
    "        if i < 5:\n",
    "            # 前 5 个：缓存中不存在\n",
    "            blocks = random.randint(1, 10)\n",
    "            pc.set(prompt, blocks)\n",
    "            hit = False\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            # 后 5 个：缓存命中\n",
    "            existing = pc.get(prompt)\n",
    "            hit = existing is not None\n",
    "        print(f'{i+1:2d}. prompt={prompt[:25]:<25} hit={hit}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f'\\nPrefix Cache hit rate: {pc.hit_rate():.2%}')\n",
    "\n",
    "asyncio.run(simulate_prefix_cache())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c2",
