    "## 3. 多副本部署 —— 增加并发度的最简单方法\n",
    "\n",
    "**为什么需要多副本**：\n",
    "- 单副本受限于单个 GPU 的并发度（PagedAttention + Continuous Batching）\n",
    "- 长尾请求会打满队列\n",
    "- 多副本可以横向扩展吞吐量\n",
    "\n",
    "**部署模式**：\n",
    "- **客户端负载均衡**：前端用 Nginx / Envoy 把请求分发到多个副本\n",
    "- **无状态设计**：所有副本共享同一个向量库（Chroma / Qdrant）\n",
    "- **健康检查**：每个副本定期上报健康状态，前端自动剔除不健康的副本"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s3-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 多副本负载均衡器示例\n",
    "class LoadBalancer:\n",
    "    def __init__(self, backend_urls: list[str]):\n",
    "        self.backends = backend_urls\n",
    "        self.current = 0\n",
    "        self.successes = defaultdict(int)\n",
    "        self.failures = defaultdict(int)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def select_backend(self) -> str:\n",
    "        \"\"\"轮询 + 故障转移\"\"\"\n",
    "        # 简单轮询\n",
    "        backend = self.backends[self.current]\n",
    "        self.current = (self.current + 1) % len(self.backends)\n",
    "        return backend\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def record_success(self, backend: str):\n",
    "        self.successes[backend] += 1\n",
    "        # 故障转移：重置失败计数\n",
    "        self.failures[backend] = 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def record_failure(self, backend: str):\n",
    "        self.failures[backend] += 1\n",
    "        if self.failures[backend] >= 3:\n",
    "            # 连续失败 3 次，标记为不健康\n",
    "            print(f'WARNING: Backend {backend} marked as unhealthy')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def health_status(self):\n",
    "        return {b: {'success': s, 'failure': f} for b, (s, f) in zip(self.backends, [self.successes, self.failures])}\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试负载均衡器\n",
    "lb = LoadBalancer(['http://rag-1:8000', 'http://rag-2:8000', 'http://rag-3:8000'])\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟 20 次请求\n",
    "for i in range(20):\n",
    "    backend = lb.select_backend()\n",
    "    success = random.random() > 0.1  # 90% 成功率\n",
    "    if success:\n",
    "        lb.record_success(backend)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        lb.record_failure(backend)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Load balancer stats:')\n",
    "for backend, stats in lb.health_status().items():\n",
    "    print(f'  {backend}: success={stats[\"success\"]}, failures={stats[\"failure\"]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
